{"id":52,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It washes its face regularly to keep the coin on its forehead spotless. It doesn’t get along with Galarian Meowth."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It loves to collect shiny things. If it’s in a good mood, it might even let its Trainer have a look at its hoard of treasures."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"Appears to be more active at night. It loves round and shiny things. It can’t stop itself from picking them up."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It loves coins, so if you give it one, you can make friends with Meowth easily. But it’s fickle, so you can’t count on that friendship lasting."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"When visiting a junkyard, you may catch sight of it having an intense fight with Murkrow over shiny objects."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It loves shiny things. It often fights with Murkrow over prey they’re both trying to catch."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It lies around all day, becoming active near dusk. At night, it wanders the city in search of loose change."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Meowth withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this Pokémon loves shiny coins that glitter with light."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen"],"text":"Adores round objects. It wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It loves anything that shines. It especially adores coins that it picks up and secretly hoards."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It is fascinated by round objects. It can’t stop playing with them until it tires and falls asleep."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"All it does is sleep during the daytime. At night, it patrols its territory with its eyes aglow."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"MEOWTH withdraw their sharp claws into their paws to silently sneak about. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pickup","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may pick up an item another Pokémon used during a battle. It may pick up items outside of battle, too."},{"name":"Technician","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up weak moves so the Pokémon can deal more damage with them."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Yellow","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":52,"name":"Meowth","condition":null,"children":[{"id":53,"name":"Persian","condition":"Lv. 28 or Level up, High Friendship","children":[]},{"id":863,"name":"Perrserker","condition":"Lv. 28","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,45],[1,252],[4,364],[8,10],[12,6],[16,44],[20,269],[24,372],[29,154],[32,103],[36,163],[40,417],[44,583]],"machine":[332,97,133,34,204,886,399,91,38,283,203,263,313,206,492,441,270,304,196,282,808,232,417,220,583,408,182,244,240,156,402,247,421,214,555,180,164,241,129,36,269,851,168,675,87,86,85,885,369],"egg":[343,175,95,387,180,39],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-139","name":"Alolan Meowth","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"139","artist":"OKUBO","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-139/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-139/large"},{"id":"me55-89","name":"Alolan Meowth","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"89","artist":"Natsumi Yoshida","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-89/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-89/large"},{"id":"me55-101","name":"Galarian Meowth","set":"30th Celeb